# Route: guide 35 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 57, 49 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades, Undercity, Alterac Mountains):
# Light's Hope Chapel -> The Infectis Scar -> Light's Hope Chapel ->
# Darrowshire -> The Undercroft -> Terrordale -> Light's Hope Chapel -> The
# Marris Stead -> The Undercroft -> The Fungal Vale -> Light's Hope Chapel ->
# Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Terrordale -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...
# (6135; Duskwing 60); The Corpulent One (6136; Borelgore 61); The Star, the
# Hand and the Heart (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh
# the Undying 44); The Crown of Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein (6163), Dead
# Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Vorrel's Revenge (1051),
# Barov Family Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of
# Rath'mael (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), The
# Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109),
# Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The Power to Destroy...
# (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague
# (95216), Source of Power (96988), Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave
# Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

